{
  "kind": "html",
  "caption": "从根结点开始：若当前结点有左子树，就找到左子树最右侧的结点，把原右子树接到它的右边，再把整棵左子树移到当前结点右边。随后沿新的 right 指针继续处理，动画用示例展示每次原地改线以及已确定的先序前缀。整个过程中 left 都被置为 null，最终得到顺序为 1 → 2 → 3 → 4 → 5 → 6 的单链表，额外空间为 O(1)。",
  "html": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>二叉树展开为链表</title>\n<style>\n*{box-sizing:border-box}html,body{margin:0;background:#1c1c1c;color:#d4d4d4;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,\"PingFang SC\",sans-serif;font-size:12px;line-height:1.45}main{max-width:560px;margin:0 auto;padding:8px 10px 10px;display:grid;gap:8px}.panel{padding:8px 10px;border:1px solid #3c3c3c;border-radius:6px;background:#252526}h1{font-size:14px;margin:0 0 4px;font-weight:600}#step{color:#9cdcfe;font-family:\"SF Mono\",Monaco,Menlo,monospace;font-size:12px}.rule{margin-top:8px;padding:8px 10px;border-left:3px solid #3794ff;background:#252526;font-size:12px}.layout{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:8px}.section-title{margin:0 0 6px;font-size:13px;font-weight:600}.tree{display:grid;gap:6px}.tree-row{display:flex;justify-content:center;gap:12px;flex-wrap:wrap}.node{width:38px;min-height:48px;padding:4px 2px;border:1px solid #3c3c3c;border-radius:4px;background:#252526;text-align:center;transition:.35s}.node .value{font:14px \"SF Mono\",Monaco,Menlo,monospace;font-weight:600}.node .label{display:block;margin-top:2px;font-size:10px;color:#8d8d8d}.node.current{background:#0e639c;border-color:#3794ff;color:#fff}.node.pre{background:#473d18;border-color:#dcdcaa}.node.moved{background:#173b2c;border-color:#4ec9b0}.edge-note{display:flex;justify-content:center;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:6px;min-height:24px}.tag{padding:2px 7px;border-radius:4px;background:#252526;border:1px solid #3c3c3c;font-size:10px}.tag.blue{background:#0e639c;border-color:#3794ff;color:#fff}.action{min-height:auto;padding:8px 10px;border-radius:6px;background:#252526;border:1px solid #3c3c3c;font-size:12px}.action strong{color:#3794ff}.pointers{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:6px}.pointer{padding:8px 10px;border-radius:6px;background:#252526;border:1px solid #3c3c3c;font-size:12px}.pointer span{display:block;color:#9cdcfe;margin-bottom:4px;font-size:10px}.pointer code{font:13px \"SF Mono\",Monaco,Menlo,monospace;color:#d4d4d4}.chain{display:flex;align-items:center;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:6px}.cell{min-width:38px;padding:4px 2px;border:1px solid #3c3c3c;border-radius:4px;background:#252526;text-align:center;font-size:12px}.cell .num{font:14px \"SF Mono\",Monaco,Menlo,monospace;font-weight:600}.cell .ptrs{margin-top:2px;font-size:10px;color:#8d8d8d}.cell.done{background:#0e639c;border-color:#3794ff;color:#fff}.arrow{color:#3794ff;font:12px \"SF Mono\",Monaco,Menlo,monospace}.progress{height:3px;background:#3c3c3c;border-radius:3px;margin-top:8px}.bar{height:100%;background:#3794ff;border-radius:3px;transition:width .4s}.legend{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;color:#8d8d8d;font-size:10px}.dot{display:inline-block;width:8px;height:8px;margin-right:4px;border-radius:3px;background:#0e639c;border:1px solid #3794ff}.dot.pre{background:#473d18;border-color:#dcdcaa}.dot.move{background:#173b2c;border-color:#4ec9b0}\n.tree .node{width:auto;min-width:74px;max-width:150px}.tree .node .label{white-space:normal}</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<main>\n<section class=\"panel\">\n<div class=\"top\"><h1>原地展开：把左子树插入右侧</h1><div id=\"step\">步骤 1 / 6</div></div>\n<div class=\"rule\">处理规则：当前结点有左子树时，先找左子树的最右结点 <b>前驱</b>；令“前驱.right = 原右子树”，再令“当前.right = 原左子树、当前.left = null”。</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"layout\">\n<div class=\"panel\">\n<h2 class=\"section-title\">结点按原树位置排列, L / R 显示实际指向</h2>\n<div class=\"tree\">\n<div class=\"tree-row\"><div class=\"node\" data-v=\"1\"><div class=\"value\">1</div><span class=\"label\">结点</span></div></div>\n<div class=\"tree-row wide\"><div class=\"node\" data-v=\"2\"><div class=\"value\">2</div><span class=\"label\">左孩子</span></div><div class=\"node\" data-v=\"5\"><div class=\"value\">5</div><span class=\"label\">右孩子</span></div></div>\n<div class=\"tree-row\"><div class=\"node\" data-v=\"3\"><div class=\"value\">3</div><span class=\"label\">左孩子</span></div><div class=\"node\" data-v=\"4\"><div class=\"value\">4</div><span class=\"label\">右孩子</span></div><div class=\"node\" data-v=\"6\"><div class=\"value\">6</div><span class=\"label\">右孩子</span></div></div>\n<div class=\"edge-note\" id=\"edgeNotes\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"panel detail\">\n<h2 class=\"section-title\">本步改线</h2>\n<div class=\"action\" id=\"action\"></div>\n<div class=\"pointers\"><div class=\"pointer\"><span>当前结点 current</span><code id=\"current\">1</code></div><div class=\"pointer\"><span>左子树最右结点 pre</span><code id=\"pre\">4</code></div></div>\n<div class=\"legend\"><span><i class=\"dot\"></i>当前结点</span><span><i class=\"dot pre\"></i>前驱</span><span><i class=\"dot move\"></i>刚接入右链</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"panel chain-panel\">\n<h2 class=\"section-title\">已确定的先序链表前缀</h2>\n<div class=\"chain\" id=\"chain\"></div>\n<div class=\"progress\"><div class=\"bar\" id=\"bar\"></div></div>\n</section>\n</main>\n<script>\nconst tree={1:{left:2,right:5},2:{left:3,right:4},3:{left:null,right:null},4:{left:null,right:null},5:{left:null,right:6},6:{left:null,right:null}},steps=[],prefix=[];\nfunction snapshot(cur,pre,moved,notes,text){steps.push({cur,pre,moved,notes,text,prefix:prefix.slice(),tree:JSON.parse(JSON.stringify(tree))});}\nlet cur=1;\nwhile(cur!==null){snapshot(cur,null,[],['开始处理结点 '+cur],'沿 right 来到 '+cur+', 检查它是否有左子树.');\n if(tree[cur].left!==null){let pre=tree[cur].left;snapshot(cur,pre,[],['从左孩子 '+pre+' 开始'],'沿左子树的 right 链查找最右结点.');while(tree[pre].right!==null){pre=tree[pre].right;snapshot(cur,pre,[],['沿 right 查找到 '+pre],'仍有右孩子则继续, 最后一个结点用来承接原右子树.');}\n tree[pre].right=tree[cur].right;snapshot(cur,pre,[pre],[''+pre+'.right ← '+(tree[pre].right??'null')],'先保存原右子树: 接到左子树最右结点之后.');\n tree[cur].right=tree[cur].left;snapshot(cur,pre,[cur],[''+cur+'.right ← '+tree[cur].right],'把左子树接到当前结点的 right, 暂时尚未清空 left.');\n tree[cur].left=null;snapshot(cur,pre,[cur],[''+cur+'.left ← null'],'清空 left, 完成当前结点的三次改线.');}\n prefix.push(cur);snapshot(cur,null,[cur],['固定先序前缀: '+prefix.join(' → ')],'当前结点的最终后继已确定, 继续沿 right 前进.');cur=tree[cur].right;\n}\nsnapshot(null,null,[],['所有 left 均为 null'],'展开完成: 1 → 2 → 3 → 4 → 5 → 6. 时间 O(n), 额外空间 O(1); 动画快照仅用于展示.');\nconst values=[1,2,3,4,5,6];let index=0;\nfunction render(){const s=steps[index];document.getElementById('step').textContent='步骤 '+(index+1)+' / '+steps.length;document.getElementById('action').textContent=s.text;document.getElementById('current').textContent=s.cur??'—';document.getElementById('pre').textContent=s.pre??'无需查找';\n document.querySelectorAll('.node').forEach(n=>{const v=Number(n.dataset.v),links=s.tree[v];n.className='node';let role='';if(v===s.cur){n.classList.add('current');role='current ';}if(v===s.pre){n.classList.add('pre');role+='pre ';}else if(s.moved.includes(v))n.classList.add('moved');n.querySelector('.label').textContent=role+'L: '+(links.left??'null')+' / R: '+(links.right??'null');});\n document.getElementById('edgeNotes').innerHTML=s.notes.map(x=>'<span class=\"tag blue\">'+x+'</span>').join('');document.getElementById('chain').innerHTML=s.prefix.length?s.prefix.map((v,i)=>(i?'<span class=\"arrow\">→</span>':'')+'<div class=\"cell done\"><div class=\"num\">'+v+'</div><div class=\"ptrs\">left: null<br>right: '+(s.tree[v].right??'null')+'</div></div>').join(''):'尚未固定任何结点';document.getElementById('bar').style.width=s.prefix.length/values.length*100+'%';index=(index+1)%steps.length;}\nrender();setInterval(render,2000);\n</script>\n</body>\n</html>",
  "svg": "",
  "media": ""
}
